    "turn_text": "With the election of Donald Trump, staying informed is more important than ever, and we're thankful you've chosen to listen to the DSR Network. Through the turbulent times ahead, we will continue to provide the insightful expert analysis on the issues that matter most around the world. We ask that you consider becoming a member to support our effort to provide you the best content possible. DSR members gain access to an ad-free listening experience, exclusive members-only segments of our shows, our members-only Discord community, and more. Use code HOLIDAY25 to get 50% off of your membership subscription at the DSRNetwork.com slash buy. That's code HOLIDAY25 at the DSRNetwork.com slash buy. The DSR Network will evolve in exciting ways in the new year, and we hope you'll join us.",
