    "turn_idx": 22,
    "turn_text": "You know, again, it would be according to the substance of the bill and what that would look like. I am certainly willing to support keeping Congress Moving forward, these have been pretty historic times and the chaos that has gone on in the house, I think is bad for the institution. It's bad for our government. It's bad for delivering to the American people. So if if we can continue to move forward with priorities that are necessary to the country. Um, and Johnson commits to doing that, then certainly I would consider supporting him, but that is all pretty speculative right now as, you know, before we've seen the text of these bills and before we understand what the Republican conference might do and whether or not they'll support him through it and how many votes he might need.",
