  {
    "episode_id": 43779,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/3/43779.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "You're a member of the Armed Services Committee, so I want to ask you about some of the substance here. Obviously, Russia has made gains in their war of conquest against Ukraine. I've got to think you've seen some of the real intelligence without divulging anything too specific. Is there a sense that the US passing something now is sufficient and timely enough to make a real difference?",
